# Cursor & Windsurf Instruction Bridge

Always start by reading [.icm/START_HERE.md](file:///d:/icm_dev1/.icm/START_HERE.md).
Follow the 3-Layered Routing Architecture:
- Layer 1: .icm/START_HERE.md & .icm/PROGRESS.md
- Layer 2: .icm/workspaces/[domain]/context.md
